Package: sequnit
Type: Package
Title: Sequential Monitoring of Randomised Unit Tests
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Efthymios", "Costa", email = "efthymios.costa17@imperial.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Axel", "Gandy", role = "aut"))
Description: Monitors randomised unit tests across successive code changes
    with a non-restarting cumulative sum (CUSUM) chart. Each test supplies a
    p-value, and the chart accumulates evidence of a code defect while keeping
    the rate of false alarms under control. While the chart is high, further
    p-values are drawn within the same commit, up to a maximum number of
    steps, which shortens the time to detection. The package designs the
    chart, records its state in JSON Lines logs, plots the logs and generates
    GitHub Actions workflows that keep the logs from one run to the next.
